.TH REMOVEXATTR 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
removexattr \- removes an extended attribute by path, following symbolic links
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/xattr.h>
.B int removexattr(const char* path, const char* name);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Removes an extended attribute by path, following symbolic links.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR removexattr (2)
